        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-301379",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Along with our technical know-how in the chip and package sectors, we are able to further integrate electrical, thermal and mechanical manufacturing resources to provide customers with one-stop system services.",
        "start_character": 9827,
        "end_character": 10037
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-301379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-301379-7485f88f21f835a6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-301379",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Besides the standard products, we provide customization service for all market segments.",
        "start_character": 8848,
        "end_character": 8936
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-301379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-301379-7485f88f21f835a6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-301379",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By leveraging the fabless business model, we expect to be able to minimize our own research and development costs associated with chip products, increase the scale of our business without increasing overhead and diversify our business risk among many sales channels.",
        "start_character": 22246,
        "end_character": 22512
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-301379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-301379-7485f88f21f835a6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-301379",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we sell a portion of our LED chips products to packaging customers and LED chip distributors.",
        "start_character": 17522,
        "end_character": 17628
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-301379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-301379-7485f88f21f835a6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-301379",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Over the long term, we expect to invest substantially in LED component products development and production equipment while managing our costs and expenses.",
        "start_character": 13321,
        "end_character": 13476
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-301379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-301379-7485f88f21f835a6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-301379",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To succeed, however, we must continue to manufacture products that meet the demanding requirements of high performance at low costs.",
        "start_character": 22831,
        "end_character": 22963
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-301379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-301379-7485f88f21f835a6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-301379",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also contract other manufacturers to produce for our sale certain LED products, and for certain aspects of our product fabrication, assembly and packaging processes, based on our design and technology requirements and under our quality control specifications and final inspection process.",
        "start_character": 1581,
        "end_character": 1872
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-301379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-301379-7485f88f21f835a6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-301379",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also sell our “Enhanced Vertical,” or EV, LED product series in blue, white, green and UV in selected markets.",
        "start_character": 1235,
        "end_character": 1348
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-301379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-301379-7485f88f21f835a6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-301379",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also use contract manufacturers to produce certain LED products, and for certain aspects of our product fabrication, assembly and packaging processes, based on our design and technology requirements and under our quality control specifications and final inspection process.",
        "start_character": 12783,
        "end_character": 13059
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-301379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-301379-7485f88f21f835a6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-301379",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also aware of a number of well-funded private companies that are developing competing products.",
        "start_character": 23499,
        "end_character": 23601
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-301379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-301379-7485f88f21f835a6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-301379",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We do not account for a significant percentage of the total market volume today, and we face significant competition from other more established providers of similar products as well as from new entrants into our markets.",
        "start_character": 22964,
        "end_character": 23185
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-301379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-301379-7485f88f21f835a6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-301379",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We do not manufacture our lighting products from the raw materials, but we assemble our lighting products from individual components, such as LED emitters, electronic components, printed circuit boards, heat-sink, lenses and other metal and plastic components.",
        "start_character": 14093,
        "end_character": 14353
      }
